.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_LINK_UTILS 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_link_load_objects ,
.Nm elf_link_unload_objects ,
.Nm elf_link_resolve_symbol ,
.Nm elf_link_add_got_section ,
.Nm elf_link_add_plt_section ,
.Nm elf_link_add_dynamic_entry
.Nd helper routines for linker frontends using libelfobj
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_load_objects "const char **paths" "size_t count" "elfobj_t ***out_objs" "size_t *out_count"
.Ft void
.Fn elf_link_unload_objects "elfobj_t **objs" "size_t count"
.Ft elf_symbol_t *
.Fn elf_link_resolve_symbol "elfobj_t **inputs" "size_t count" "const char *name" "size_t *input_index_out"
.Ft elf_section_t *
.Fn elf_link_add_got_section "elfobj_t *obj" "size_t entries"
.Ft elf_section_t *
.Fn elf_link_add_plt_section "elfobj_t *obj" "size_t entries"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_add_dynamic_entry "elfobj_t *obj" "int64_t tag" "uint64_t value"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These functions support linker frontends that orchestrate object loading,
symbol resolution, and dynamic-link support section construction.
.Pp
.Fn elf_link_load_objects
opens multiple input files into an array of
.Vt elfobj_t
handles; release them with
.Fn elf_link_unload_objects .
.Pp
.Fn elf_link_resolve_symbol
searches inputs for a symbol and optionally reports the matching input index.
.Pp
.Fn elf_link_add_got_section
and
.Fn elf_link_add_plt_section
create GOT/PLT helper sections sized for
.Fa entries .
.Fn elf_link_add_dynamic_entry
appends one dynamic-table tag/value pair.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn elf_link_resolve_symbol
returns NULL if no matching symbol is found.
.Fn elf_link_add_got_section
and
.Fn elf_link_add_plt_section
return NULL on failure.
.Pp
.Fn elf_link_load_objects
and
.Fn elf_link_add_dynamic_entry
return
.Dv ELF_OK
on success and
.Vt elf_err_t
on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_link 3 ,
.Xr elf_link_plan 3 ,
.Xr elf_open 3 ,
.Xr elf_section 3 ,
.Xr elf_symbol 3 ,
.Xr elfobj 3
